    "status_basis": "2026-11-10 flow-verification job seven-newchar-20261110: the reference, the live Max character and the new empty target NewControlRigRuntimeAsset1 were treated as different characters. Independent binding probe found the target equivalent to the reference (149 bones, same mesh, 87 morphs, 0 controls). Empty-target build produced 149 bones, 72 animation controls, 1 Visual Cue, 28 curves, 1926 nodes, 2639 links. Reference transfer 1175 cases worst 0 before and after reload, display contract 0 differences, upper-lid Max spot-check 0.00344 cm / 0.00059 deg, save-reload passed with the reference package unchanged. Normal-frame preview FAILED (rig clock stuck at 0.4 s, two refreshes did not recover); legacy per-part regression baselines do not apply to this lineage. Reports: target project Saved/FaceMigration/Jobs/seven-newchar-20261110/Current/Evidence. Final user visual and picking acceptance pending.",
    "current_visual_acceptance": "pending",
    "structure_counts_basis": "Current flow-verification run: 149 bones, 72 animation controls, 1 Visual Cue, 28 curves, 1926 nodes, 2639 links, 109 execution edges, 57 animated bone outputs. The retired NewControlRigRuntimeAsset had 9804 nodes and 87 hierarchy curves."
